| Clarity / flow | 7 | 8 | Ch18, Karis pushes `none observed` into “a declaration smeared across four hours”; Ch19–20 moves from the day-79 correction and four-day rest back to the day-77 bracket posting without an explicit rewind. Ideas are intelligible, but the density and chronology seam can cost a first-pass reader. | High |
