   101	The Force boy gathered and threw, and the throw went off the floor like a door slammed in a stairwell, a flat crack of air that turned every head in the yard. The Current girl had been there. She was not there now; she had gone along the line of the force on its own current, the way that Path went, and come off it two paces to the side with her hand reaching. The whole yard looked round at it, as a yard will at a door banging.
   102	
   103	In the curve of the lamp, the small figure did not turn.
   104	
