    30	
    31	He had known this since his first week, had written it down without self-pity, and had decided what to do about it in about the length of time it took to write. If he could not be in the ladder, he was going to be the best-informed person who had ever watched one.
    32	
    33	Eleven Paths competed across the three brackets. He had a page for each of them by the season's fourth session.
    34	
