   127	He went to every session. Not the ones Lira fought, or the ones Brom fought — every session, including practice hours, including the Silver bracket's thin column, where nineteen names produced maybe two bouts a fortnight, including the Iron bracket afternoons where Ephram held a court that was not quite a court.
